              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eOpen a basket into each cavity, record what the die makes during your shift, then release the baskets when they are full.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCheck the die\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eDie\u003c/span\u003e box at the top names the tool mounted on this machine, and the cavity rows below come from it. If it is empty or names a different die, stop and tell a supervisor \u0026ndash; do not work around it.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eOpen a basket into each cavity\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eOn \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOpen Basket\u003c/span\u003e, each row is one cavity. Pick the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003ePart\u003c/span\u003e for the cavity, then scan the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLTT Barcode\u003c/span\u003e from the basket into that row. Press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOPEN BASKETS\u003c/span\u003e to open every row you filled in.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12.5px;color:#9AA8BF;font-style:italic;padding:2px 0 14px 46px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eIf every cavity on this die runs the same part, \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eCopy part to empty rows\u003c/span\u003e fills the empty rows for you instead of picking the part on each one.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eRecord what the die made\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eOn \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eRecord Shift Output\u003c/span\u003e, choose your \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eReporting shift\u003c/span\u003e and enter the shot count. Press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eCompute / Preview\u003c/span\u003e, then use \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eAdd scrap reason\u003c/span\u003e on any cavity that had scrap \u0026ndash; \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eGood (pc)\u003c/span\u003e updates on its own as you log it. Press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eSUBMIT SHIFT OUTPUT\u003c/span\u003e when the rows look right.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e4\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eRelease the full baskets\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eOn \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLot Release\u003c/span\u003e, press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eRelease\u003c/span\u003e on a basket that is full. It leaves the cavity, moves on to its next step, and frees the cavity for a new basket. \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eVoid\u003c/span\u003e only appears on an empty basket and discards it.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"border-top:1px solid #172238;margin:2px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#093240;border-left:5px solid #22A8CC;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 14px;margin:4px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;padding-bottom:4px;\"\u003eIf a basket goes over its count\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe row shows \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOver basket headroom\u003c/span\u003e and tells you how many pieces fit and how many overflow. Leave \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOverfill this basket\u003c/span\u003e unchecked to release the basket at its limit and scan a new LTT for the extra pieces. Check it instead to keep everything in the one basket and carry on past the limit.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
              "style": {
                "fontSize": 13,
                "overflow": "auto"
              }
            },
            "type": "ia.display.markdown"
          }
        ],
